    "digest": "🎬 A silent listicle reel curating 6 classic motivational and commencement speeches on YouTube, each paired with a one-line life principle.\n🏷 Recommendations · Mindset\n\n🎧 <b>WATCH / LISTEN</b>\n• <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ji5_MqicxSo\">Last Lecture: Achieving Your Childhood Dreams (CMU, 2007)</a>\n   ↳ You don&#x27;t have unlimited time. A storytelling + legacy masterclass delivered weeks after a terminal diagnosis — directly relevant to how you frame purpose-driven content. 📅 ~75-min block.\n• <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qp0HIF3SfI4\">How Great Leaders Inspire Action (TED)</a>\n   ↳ People follow purpose, not products. Start-With-Why is the core marketing frame for the athlete/Gameplan platform: lead with the mission, not the feature set.\n• <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qOY_2nVozLA\">The Strangest Secret</a>\n   ↳ You become what you think about. Foundational mindset audio — good background-listen while working. 📅 ~35 min.\n• <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pxBQLFLei70\">UT Austin 2014 Commencement (&#x27;Make Your Bed&#x27;)</a>\n   ↳ Small wins build big lives. The daily-discipline framing maps onto sustaining a consistent content and build cadence.\n• <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A311CnTjfos\">The Man in the Arena</a>\n   ↳ Ignore the crowd, enter the arena. A 3-minute reframe on building in public despite critics — quick fuel for a founder posting daily.\n• <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8CrOL-ydFMI\">This Is Water Commencement Speech</a>\n   ↳ You choose the meaning of your reality. On attention and deliberate framing — a useful lens for both mindset and narrative craft. 📅 ~22 min.\n\n📝 Action Inbox/2026-06-13 6 perspective-shift videos.md · 🗂 Notion: 1 reel · 6 items",
