  "https://www.instagram.com/reel/C6aQlKArskF/?igsh=NTc4MTIwNjQ2YQ==": {
    "status": "done",
    "digest": "🎬 A motivational reel urging you to start now, scared and unprepared, because no one is coming to push you and your time isn&#x27;t unlimited.\n🏷 Quote · Mindset\n📄 <i>Do it scared. Do it unprepared. Just start! The perfect moment to go after your dreams doesn&#x27;t exist. You&#x27;re as ready now as you&#x27;ll ever be. Surround yourself with people who push you to do more, not less. Take a single step today, not tomorrow.</i>\n\n💬 <b>QUOTE</b>\n• <b>“You have to do it scared and you have to do it unprepared. You&#x27;re never gonna feel ready.”</b> — meral.eth\n   ↳ Tight, repeatable short-form hook on starting before you feel ready — raw material for an athlete-platform motivational post.\n• <b>“This is the youngest you&#x27;re ever gonna be, this is the most energy you&#x27;re ever gonna have. So stop putting your dreams off.”</b> — meral.eth\n   ↳ Classic urgency reframe; strong caption-ready line for content built around starting now.\n• <b>“No one&#x27;s coming to save you, no one&#x27;s coming to push you. This is you versus you.”</b> — meral.eth\n   ↳ Ownership/self-accountability framing that fits the founder-grind narrative and resonates with an athlete audience.\n• <b>“This isn&#x27;t the dress rehearsal, this is the real thing, this is your life. Just start, commit to showing up every day, and watch your dreams come true.”</b> — meral.eth\n   ↳ The &#x27;show up every day&#x27; close is the consistency principle behind any content pipeline — good closing line for a reel.\n\n📝 Action Inbox/2026-06-13 Do It Scared.md · 🗂 Notion: 1 reel · 4 items",
    "platform": "instagram",
    "ts": "2026-06-13T13:55:11"
