    "digest": "🎬 Short motivational reel: fear of jumping is the signal to jump — staying put is the only real risk.\n🏷 Quote · Mindset\n📄 <i>the only more scary thing than to jump is not to jump and stay the same your whole life. change is a privilege, having challenges to face is a privilege. go do something scary today:)</i>\n\n💬 <b>QUOTE</b>\n• <b>“When it feels scary to jump, that is exactly when you jump. Otherwise, you end up staying in the same place your whole life. And that I can&#x27;t do.”</b> — monikakaterose\n   ↳ Direct framing for shipping before it feels ready — relevant to posting riskier content ideas or making bold moves on the athlete platform. Related Obsidian note: Clippings/Everything is a win when the goal is experience.md echoes the same bias toward action over safety.\n\n📝 Action Inbox/2026-06-13 Do something scary today.md · 🗂 Notion: 1 reel · 1 items",
