  "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DY0Qd-VRw1q/": {
    "status": "done",
    "digest": "🎬 A curated back-to-back watch list of 5 TED/TEDx talks on procrastination, grit, laziness, and intrinsic motivation — pitched as a 1-hour focus session with note-taking.\n🏷 Recommendations · Mindset\n📄 <i>These five Ted Talks will really shift something inside of you and almost make laziness feel illegal. I suggest you take an hour of your time and watch them, back to back and take notes. They&#x27;ve got millions of views for a reason!</i>\n\n🎧 <b>WATCH / LISTEN</b>\n• <a href=\"https://www.ted.com/talks/tim_urban_inside_the_mind_of_a_master_procrastinator\">Inside the Mind of a Master Procrastinator</a>\n   ↳ Foundational framing of why founders and athletes avoid hard things — great content hook for consistency and shipping habits on the athlete platform. 📅 ~14 min\n• <a href=\"https://www.ted.com/talks/angela_lee_duckworth_grit_the_power_of_passion_and_perseverance\">Grit: The Power of Passion and Perseverance</a>\n   ↳ Core science behind long-term athletic performance with 24M views — directly maps to athlete platform messaging and is a proven evergreen hook for your audience. 📅 ~6 min\n• <a href=\"https://www.ted.com/talks/esther_boykin_the_antidote_to_laziness_isn_t_what_you_think\">The Antidote to Laziness Isn&#x27;t What You Think</a>\n   ↳ Therapist reframes laziness as compassion fatigue — opens an athlete-wellbeing content angle around burnout and recovery that differentiates your platform. 📅 ~12 min\n• <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DCh3N2ulmJY\">How to Succeed Without Confidence, Motivation, or Healing</a>\n   ↳ Former Secret Service agent argues action beats feelings — strong ready-to-clip soundbite for athlete platform content on discipline over motivation. 📅 ~18 min\n• <a href=\"https://www.ted.com/talks/dan_pink_the_puzzle_of_motivation\">The Puzzle of Motivation</a>\n   ↳ Intrinsic vs extrinsic motivation research — directly useful for athlete platform retention strategy and thinking about what keeps users engaged long-term. 📅 ~18 min\n\n📝 Action Inbox/2026-06-13 5 TED Talks on Motivation.md · 🗂 Notion: 1 reel · 5 items",
    "markdown": "# 5 TED Talks to kill laziness\n\n*🏷 Recommendations · Mindset*\n\nA curated back-to-back watch list of 5 TED/TEDx talks on procrastination, grit, laziness, and intrinsic motivation — pitched as a 1-hour focus session with note-taking.\n\n> These five Ted Talks will really shift something inside of you and almost make laziness feel illegal. I suggest you take an hour of your time and watch them, back to back and take notes. They've got millions of views for a reason!\n\n---\n\n### 🎧 Watch / Listen\n- [Inside the Mind of a Master Procrastinator](https://www.ted.com/talks/tim_urban_inside_the_mind_of_a_master_procrastinator) — Foundational framing of why founders and athletes avoid hard things — great content hook for consistency and shipping habits on the athlete platform. 📅 ~14 min\n- [Grit: The Power of Passion and Perseverance](https://www.ted.com/talks/angela_lee_duckworth_grit_the_power_of_passion_and_perseverance) — Core science behind long-term athletic performance with 24M views — directly maps to athlete platform messaging and is a proven evergreen hook for your audience. 📅 ~6 min\n- [The Antidote to Laziness Isn't What You Think](https://www.ted.com/talks/esther_boykin_the_antidote_to_laziness_isn_t_what_you_think) — Therapist reframes laziness as compassion fatigue — opens an athlete-wellbeing content angle around burnout and recovery that differentiates your platform. 📅 ~12 min\n- [How to Succeed Without Confidence, Motivation, or Healing](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DCh3N2ulmJY) — Former Secret Service agent argues action beats feelings — strong ready-to-clip soundbite for athlete platform content on discipline over motivation. 📅 ~18 min\n- [The Puzzle of Motivation](https://www.ted.com/talks/dan_pink_the_puzzle_of_motivation) — Intrinsic vs extrinsic motivation research — directly useful for athlete platform retention strategy and thinking about what keeps users engaged long-term. 📅 ~18 min\n\n---\n\n*📝 Action Inbox/2026-06-13 5 TED Talks on Motivation.md · 🗂 Notion: 1 reel · 5 items*",
