    "digest": "<b>🎬 4 Videos for Content Mastery</b>\n🏷 <i>Content &amp; Creator · Recommendations</i>\nShort-form reel listing four YouTube videos recommended for getting good at content creation, covering personal brand building, viral hooks, and reels strategy.\n<blockquote>Creator recommends four YouTube videos: Caleb Ralston on the 3 stages of personal brand, Kalloway&#x27;s study of 100 viral hooks (6 best performers), Mino Lee on writing hooks that get 1M+ views, and Jack Neel on reels strategy and making $2M with one video.</blockquote>\n<b>🎧 Watch / Listen</b>\n⚠️ <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@CalebRalston\">The 3 Stages of Your Personal Brand</a> <i>(channel confirmed at @CalebRalston; exact video title not surfaced in search — linking to channel)</i>\n✅ <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xnOe8aA9Pmw\">I Studied 100 Viral Hooks, These 6 Will Make You Go Viral</a> <i>(confirmed on YouTube, 296K views)</i>\n✅ <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SVikuuB2vkU\">how i create hooks that get 1M+ views every time (just copy me)</a> <i>(confirmed on YouTube, exact title match)</i>\n✅ <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HzoQgQS8czE\">Reels Expert: I Made $2M With One Video (Steal This Viral Hook!)</a> <i>(confirmed on YouTube; shown under show title $40M At 20 in the reel thumbnail; caption misattributes this slot to Ava from personalbrandlaunch)</i>\n<i>📝 Action Inbox/2026-06-13 4 Videos for Content Mastery.md · 🗂 Notion: 1 reel · 4 items</i>",
