    "digest": "<b>🎬 7 Storytelling Frameworks for Brands</b>\n🏷 <i>Content &amp; Creator</i>\n10-slide Instagram carousel by marketing coach Nisha Singh listing 7 storytelling frameworks used by big brands, with a brief breakdown of each.\n<blockquote>Covers Hero&#x27;s Journey, PAS, BAB, AIDA, 3-Act Structure, Dramatic Arc, and WHW Story — each explained with its core steps and recommended use cases (ads, reels, landing pages, etc.).</blockquote>\n<i>No actionable items in this one.</i>\n<b>📜 Slides</b>\n<b>Slide 1</b> — <i>Cover slide with title on textured white background and author byline at bottom</i>\nFollow for More  @marketingnisha\n7 Storytelling Frameworks (Used by Big Brands...)\nNisha Singh  Marketing Coach\n\n<b>Slide 2</b> — <i>Mind-map overview listing all 7 frameworks branching from a central node</i>\nFollow for More  @marketingnisha\nHero&#x27;s Journey\nPAB Technique\nBAB Technique\nThe AIDA Rule\n3-Act Structure\nDramatic Arc\nThe &quot;WHW&quot; Story\n\n<b>Slide 3</b> — <i>White slide detailing Framework 1 with three bullet points and use-case label</i>\nFollow for More  @marketingnisha\nFramework 1 - The HERO&#x27;s Journey\nAudience = The Hero\nYou = The Guide\nShow:\nTheir Challenge\nThe Transformation\nThe Success\nGreat For: Brand Stories, Testimonials\n\n<b>Slide 4</b> — <i>Dark slide detailing Framework 2 (PAS) with orange underline accent</i>\nFollow for More  @marketingnisha\nFramework 2 - PAS\nProblem → Agitate → Solve\nShow:\nThe Problem\nIntensify the pain\nProvide the solution\nGreat For: Sales Pages, Reels, Ads.\n\n<b>Slide 5</b> — <i>White slide detailing Framework 3 (BAB) with arrow diagrams for each stage</i>\nFollow for More  @marketingnisha\nFramework 3 - BAB\nBefore → After → Bridge\nBefore\nWhat life looks like now.\nAfter\nThe dream outcome\nBridge\nHow your product/service gets them there\nGreat For: Landing Pages, Pitches\n\n<b>Slide 6</b> — <i>Dark slide detailing Framework 4 (AIDA) with yellow badge icons for each letter</i>\nFollow for More  @marketingnisha\nFramework 4 - AIDA\n<i>📝 Action Inbox/2026-06-13 7 Storytelling Frameworks for Brands.md · 🗂 Notion: 1 reel · 0 items</i>",
    "markdown": "<b>🎬 7 Storytelling Frameworks for Brands</b>\n🏷 <i>Content &amp; Creator</i>\n10-slide Instagram carousel by marketing coach Nisha Singh listing 7 storytelling frameworks used by big brands, with a brief breakdown of each.\n<blockquote>Covers Hero&#x27;s Journey, PAS, BAB, AIDA, 3-Act Structure, Dramatic Arc, and WHW Story — each explained with its core steps and recommended use cases (ads, reels, landing pages, etc.).</blockquote>\n<i>No actionable items in this one.</i>\n<details><summary>📜 Slides</summary><b>Slide 1</b> — <i>Cover slide with title on textured white background and author byline at bottom</i>\nFollow for More  @marketingnisha\n7 Storytelling Frameworks (Used by Big Brands...)\nNisha Singh  Marketing Coach\n\n<b>Slide 2</b> — <i>Mind-map overview listing all 7 frameworks branching from a central node</i>\nFollow for More  @marketingnisha\nHero&#x27;s Journey\nPAB Technique\nBAB Technique\nThe AIDA Rule\n3-Act Structure\nDramatic Arc\nThe &quot;WHW&quot; Story\n\n<b>Slide 3</b> — <i>White slide detailing Framework 1 with three bullet points and use-case label</i>\nFollow for More  @marketingnisha\nFramework 1 - The HERO&#x27;s Journey\nAudience = The Hero\nYou = The Guide\nShow:\nTheir Challenge\nThe Transformation\nThe Success\nGreat For: Brand Stories, Testimonials\n\n<b>Slide 4</b> — <i>Dark slide detailing Framework 2 (PAS) with orange underline accent</i>\nFollow for More  @marketingnisha\nFramework 2 - PAS\nProblem → Agitate → Solve\nShow:\nThe Problem\nIntensify the pain\nProvide the solution\nGreat For: Sales Pages, Reels, Ads.\n\n<b>Slide 5</b> — <i>White slide detailing Framework 3 (BAB) with arrow diagrams for each stage</i>\nFollow for More  @marketingnisha\nFramework 3 - BAB\nBefore → After → Bridge\nBefore\nWhat life looks like now.\nAfter\nThe dream outcome\nBridge\nHow your product/service gets them there\nGreat For: Landing Pages, Pitches\n\n<b>Slide 6</b> — <i>Dark slide detailing Framework 4 (AIDA) with yellow badge icons for each letter</i>\nFollow for More  @marketingnisha\nFramework 4 - AIDA\nATTENTION (Market Potential - Hook them)\nINTEREST (Suspects - Keep them Curious)\nDESIRE (Prospect - build desire)\nACTION (Customers - Tell what to do)\nGreat For: Ads, Reels, Captions\n\n<b>Slide 7</b> — <i>White slide detailing Framework 5 with three acts and arrow annotations</i>\nFollow for More  @marketingnisha\nFramework 5 - The 3-Act Structure\nAct 1 Setup\nAct 2 Conflict\nAct 3 Resolution\nGreat For: Long-Term Storytelling &amp; Case Studies\n\n<b>Slide 8</b> — <i>Dark slide detailing Framework 6 with a glowing red arc graphic showing tension curve</i>\nFollow for More  @marketingnisha\nFramework 6 - The Dramatic Arc\nRising Tension\nClimax\nResolution\nGreat For: Reels to hold attention\n\n<b>Slide 9</b> — <i>White slide detailing Framework 7 (WHW) with arrow annotations for each component</i>\nFollow for More  @marketingnisha\nFramework 7 - The WHW Story\nWHY Explain &quot;why&quot; the idea matters\nHOW Show them &quot;how&quot; it works.\nWHAT Tell &quot;what&quot; action to Take the next.\nGreat For: Educational Content\n\n<b>Slide 10</b> — <i>Closing CTA slide with photo of Nisha Singh in a circular frame on dark background</i>\nLIKE THIS CONTENT?\nFOLLOW FOR MORE!\n@marketingnisha</details>\n<i>📝 Action Inbox/2026-06-13 7 Storytelling Frameworks for Brands.md · 🗂 Notion: 1 reel · 0 items</i>",
