    "status": "done",
    "digest": "<b>Four Reads for High Agency</b>\n<i>“The most important trait you can have in 21st century is agency.”</i>\n\n📌 <b>Recommended</b>\n✅ <a href=\"https://www.gurwinder.blog/\">The Prism by Gurwinder</a> — Gurwinder\n✅ <a href=\"https://fs.blog/\">Farnam Street Blog</a> — Shane Parrish\n✅ <a href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/35824209-efficiency\">Efficiency: Get Rich Without Giving Up Your Life</a> — Wall Street Playboys\n✅ <a href=\"https://www.navalmanack.com/\">The Almanack of Naval Ravikant</a> — Eric Jorgenson\n\n💾 <i>Curated short-list of four high-signal resources for building agency, clear thinking, and wealth mindset.</i>\n🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DYkz82TJd8s/\">Original reel</a>\n<i>#agency #mental-models #resources</i>",
    "markdown": "<b>Four Reads for High Agency</b><br><i>“The most important trait you can have in 21st century is agency.”</i><br>📌 <b>Recommended</b><br><ol><li>✅ <a href=\"https://www.gurwinder.blog/\">The Prism by Gurwinder</a> — Gurwinder</li><li>✅ <a href=\"https://fs.blog/\">Farnam Street Blog</a> — Shane Parrish</li><li>✅ <a href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/35824209-efficiency\">Efficiency: Get Rich Without Giving Up Your Life</a> — Wall Street Playboys</li><li>✅ <a href=\"https://www.navalmanack.com/\">The Almanack of Naval Ravikant</a> — Eric Jorgenson</li></ol><br>💾 <i>Curated short-list of four high-signal resources for building agency, clear thinking, and wealth mindset.</i><br>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DYkz82TJd8s/\">Original reel</a><br><i>#agency #mental-models #resources</i><details><summary>📄 Full transcript</summary>A curated list of four resources — a Substack newsletter, a blog, a PDF/book, and a book — chosen for building agency, decision-making skills, and wealth mindset. Covers cognitive traps (The Prism), mental models (Farnam Street), productivity and wealth (Efficiency PDF), and leverage and happiness (Almanack of Naval Ravikant).\n\nThe most important trait you can have in 21st century is agency. Here are four reads that will make you disgustingly high agency. First, the prism on Substack. Start with this brilliant article, why everything is becoming a game and work your way towards avoiding the automation of your heart. Fantastic writing that makes you feel like you&#x27;ve been caught in a cognitive trap. Second, Farnham Street blog. Cleverly named after the street where Warren Buffett&#x27;s office sit. This is where you can learn about first principles thinking and second order effects. The mental models that will help you make great decisions quickly. Next, Wall Street Playboy&#x27;s efficiency PDF. Real ones know. If you read this eight years ago, you probably own an eight figure e-com business today. Fourth, the almanac of Naval Ravikant. Learn about leverage and stop trading your time for money. This one will reframe how you think about wealth and happiness in your life. Follow for more.</details>",
