    "digest": "<b>6 Claude Skills for Designers</b>\n\n📌 <b>Recommended</b>\n✅ <a href=\"https://github.com/szilu/ux-designer-skill\">UX Designer Skill</a> — szilu (Szilárd Hajba)\n✅ <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/skills/tree/main/skills/canvas-design\">Canvas Design Skill</a> — Anthropic\n✅ <a href=\"https://github.com/ParthJadhav/app-store-screenshots\">App Store Screenshots Skill</a> — ParthJadhav\n✅ <a href=\"https://github.com/Leonxlnx/taste-skill\">Taste Skill</a> — Leonxlnx (Leon Lin)\n✅ <a href=\"https://github.com/Jakubantalik/transitions.dev\">Transitions.dev Skill</a> — Jakubantalik (Jakub Antalik)\n✅ <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/skills/tree/main/skills/web-artifacts-builder\">Web Artifacts Builder Skill</a> — Anthropic\n\n💾 <i>Curated list of 6 Claude Code skills with exact install commands for designers, covering UX strategy, generative graphics, app store assets, opinionated UI style, motion polish, and interactive component building.</i>\n🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DZp3_CJCPaI/\">Original reel</a>\n<i>#claude-skills #ux-design #ai-tools</i>",
    "markdown": "<b>6 Claude Skills for Designers</b><br>📌 <b>Recommended</b><br><ol><li>✅ <a href=\"https://github.com/szilu/ux-designer-skill\">UX Designer Skill</a> — szilu (Szilárd Hajba)</li><li>✅ <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/skills/tree/main/skills/canvas-design\">Canvas Design Skill</a> — Anthropic</li><li>✅ <a href=\"https://github.com/ParthJadhav/app-store-screenshots\">App Store Screenshots Skill</a> — ParthJadhav</li><li>✅ <a href=\"https://github.com/Leonxlnx/taste-skill\">Taste Skill</a> — Leonxlnx (Leon Lin)</li><li>✅ <a href=\"https://github.com/Jakubantalik/transitions.dev\">Transitions.dev Skill</a> — Jakubantalik (Jakub Antalik)</li><li>✅ <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/skills/tree/main/skills/web-artifacts-builder\">Web Artifacts Builder Skill</a> — Anthropic</li></ol><br>💾 <i>Curated list of 6 Claude Code skills with exact install commands for designers, covering UX strategy, generative graphics, app store assets, opinionated UI style, motion polish, and interactive component building.</i><br>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DZp3_CJCPaI/\">Original reel</a><br><i>#claude-skills #ux-design #ai-tools</i><details><summary>📄 Full transcript</summary>Six installable Claude Code skills aimed at designers: UX Designer (full UX strategy), Canvas Design (PNG exports from descriptions), App Store Screenshots (store-ready exports), Taste (opinionated UI style), Transitions.dev (production CSS motion), and Web Artifacts Builder (live React/Tailwind components). Each slide gives the skill name, what it does, and the exact install command.\n\n### Slide 1\n*Title slide with man in black t-shirt pointing to an orange app icon on coral background*\n\n6 new claude skills for designers. Swipe for install commands →\n\n### Slide 2\n*Skill 01 details with example UI showing a brand design portfolio*\n\nSkill 01\nUX Designer\n\nThis turns Claude into a full UX strategist instead of just a code generator.\n\nAsk it to design a flow and it handles error states, touch targets, and WCAG contrast on its own.\n\nInstall - npx skills add szilu/ux-designer-skill\n\n### Slide 3\n*Three abstract design examples labeled Tidal Memory, Thermal Drift, and Dark Matter*\n\nSkill 02\nCanvas Design\n\nBuilt by Anthropic, this lets you describe a poster, graphic, or piece of artwork and have Claude design it for you.\n\nIt exports straight to a production-ready PNG, no Figma or Canva needed.\n\nInstall - npx skills add anthropics/skills --skill canvas-design\n\n### Slide 4\n*Five mobile app screenshot mockups showing different designs and layouts*\n\nSkill 03\nApp Store Screenshots\n\nClaude scaffolds a complete editor that exports App Store and Google Play screenshots at every required size.\n\nDevice mockups, captions, and light/dark variants are all handled for you.\n\nInstall - npx skills add PathJadhav/app-store-screenshots\n\n### Slide 5\n*Three website design examples showing cohesive design systems with typography and color*\n\nSkill 04\nTaste\n\nThis gives Claude a real point of view with its own palette, typeface, and hierarchy.\n\nYour UI stops looking like generic AI slop and starts looking actually designed.\n\nInstall - npx skills add Leonxlnx/taste-skill\n\n### Slide 6\n*Dark interface showing 8 different transition effects and animation previews with labels*\n\nSkill 05\nTransitions.dev\n\nA full catalog of production-ready transitions for modals, dropdowns, and page reveals. Claude uses it to add the kind of motion polish that makes a product feel expensive.\n\nInstall - npx skills add Jakubantalik/transitions.dev\n\n### Slide 7\n*Pricing table interface and UI component examples showing React-based interactive elements*\n\nSkill 06\nWeb Artifacts Builder\n\nClaude builds interactive React and Tailwind components live inside the chat.\n\nThings like pricing tables, toggles, and full UI blocks come out ready to drop into your project.\n\nInstall - npx skills add anthropics/skills --skill artifacts-builder\n\n### Slide 8\n*Final call-to-action slide with pixel art icon and invitation to comment*\n\nComment &quot;CLAUDE&quot; and I&#x27;ll send you all 6 skill links.</details>",
    "platform": "instagram",
    "ts": "2026-06-29T00:04:45"
  },
