    "digest": "<b>Must-Read 10/10 Startup Essays</b>\n\n📌 <b>Recommended</b>\n✅ <a href=\"https://paulgraham.com/foundermode.html\">Founder Mode</a> — Paul Graham\n⚠️ <a href=\"https://twitter.com/naval/status/1002103360646823936\">How to Get Rich Without Getting Lucky</a> — Naval Ravikant — <i>Originated as a Twitter/X tweetstorm; this URL is widely cited as the source but was not directly returned in search results — cannot confirm</i>\n✅ <a href=\"https://darioamodei.com/essay/machines-of-loving-grace\">Machines of Loving Grace</a> — Dario Amodei\n⚠️ <a href=\"https://www.wsj.com/articles/peter-thiel-competition-is-for-losers-1410535536\">Competition is for Losers</a> — Peter Thiel — <i>Originally a WSJ essay (Sept 2014); exact WSJ URL not confirmed by search results and article is paywalled — also exists as a Stanford lecture transcript</i>\n\n💾 <i>A curated shortlist of canonical startup essays from top founders and thinkers, worth reading as a set.</i>\n🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DaBbbxxzVH7/\">Original reel</a>\n<i>#startups #founders #essays</i>",
    "markdown": "<b>Must-Read 10/10 Startup Essays</b><br>📌 <b>Recommended</b><br><ol><li>✅ <a href=\"https://paulgraham.com/foundermode.html\">Founder Mode</a> — Paul Graham</li><li>⚠️ <a href=\"https://twitter.com/naval/status/1002103360646823936\">How to Get Rich Without Getting Lucky</a> — Naval Ravikant — <i>Originated as a Twitter/X tweetstorm; this URL is widely cited as the source but was not directly returned in search results — cannot confirm</i></li><li>✅ <a href=\"https://darioamodei.com/essay/machines-of-loving-grace\">Machines of Loving Grace</a> — Dario Amodei</li><li>⚠️ <a href=\"https://www.wsj.com/articles/peter-thiel-competition-is-for-losers-1410535536\">Competition is for Losers</a> — Peter Thiel — <i>Originally a WSJ essay (Sept 2014); exact WSJ URL not confirmed by search results and article is paywalled — also exists as a Stanford lecture transcript</i></li></ol><br>💾 <i>A curated shortlist of canonical startup essays from top founders and thinkers, worth reading as a set.</i><br>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DaBbbxxzVH7/\">Original reel</a><br><i>#startups #founders #essays</i><details><summary>📄 Full transcript</summary>Creator spotlights four must-read startup essays: Paul Graham&#x27;s Founder Mode, Naval Ravikant&#x27;s How to Get Rich Without Getting Lucky, Dario Amodei&#x27;s Machines of Loving Grace, and Peter Thiel&#x27;s Competition is for Losers.\n\n10 out of 10 startup essays that will put you ahead of 99% of founders. Paul Graham&#x27;s Founder Mode, Naval Ravikant, How to Get Rich Without Getting Lucky. Machines of Love and Grace by Anthropic CEO Daryl Moiti. Peter Thiel&#x27;s Competition is for Losers.</details>",
