  "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DUbuCk8D3JQ/": {
    "status": "done",
    "digest": "<b>Greek Ritual to Drain Fear</b>\n<i>Ancient Greek athletes used a two-step pre-competition ritual — vividly imagining defeat, then affirming their true form — to strip fear of its power.</i>\n\n🔑 <b>Key points</b>\n• Fear is unprocessed imagination; accepting the worst outcome drains its power.\n• Visualize losing in full, vivid detail the night before a challenge — not to discourage yourself, but to desensitize to the fear.\n• After visualizing defeat, repeat &#x27;What remains after fear is my true form&#x27; until it feels true in your body.\n• This reveals your true form after fear, judgment, and expectation fall away.\n\n💾 <i>A concise two-step Stoic technique for mentally defusing fear before high-stakes moments.</i>\n🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DUbuCk8D3JQ/\">Original reel</a>\n<i>#stoicism #fear #mindset</i>",
    "markdown": "<b>Greek Ritual to Drain Fear</b><br><i>Ancient Greek athletes used a two-step pre-competition ritual — vividly imagining defeat, then affirming their true form — to strip fear of its power.</i><br>🔑 <b>Key points</b><br><ul><li>Fear is unprocessed imagination; accepting the worst outcome drains its power.</li><li>Visualize losing in full, vivid detail the night before a challenge — not to discourage yourself, but to desensitize to the fear.</li><li>After visualizing defeat, repeat &#x27;What remains after fear is my true form&#x27; until it feels true in your body.</li><li>This reveals your true form after fear, judgment, and expectation fall away.</li></ul><br>💾 <i>A concise two-step Stoic technique for mentally defusing fear before high-stakes moments.</i><br>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DUbuCk8D3JQ/\">Original reel</a><br><i>#stoicism #fear #mindset</i><details><summary>📄 Full transcript</summary>The reel frames Stoic negative visualization as an ancient Greek athletic ritual — vividly imagine the worst outcome to drain fear of its charge, then affirm the self that persists beyond fear, judgment, and expectation.</details>",
    "platform": "instagram",
    "ts": "2026-07-04T13:22:48"
  },
