  "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DaazXLUINiv/": {
    "status": "done",
    "digest": "<b>FUEL Framework for Content Topics</b>\n<i>The FUEL acronym gives content creators a ready-made framework for never running out of things to say on camera.</i>\n\n🔑 <b>Key points</b>\n• F — First person: your daily life, purchases, businesses, and thoughts are all content.\n• U — Unpopular: say the things your audience thinks but won&#x27;t say themselves — that&#x27;s how you stand out.\n• E — Experiences: mine past struggles, challenges, and ended friendships for lessons others can learn from.\n• L — Listen: once you&#x27;re posting, your comment section tells you exactly what topics to cover next.\n\n💾 <i>Compact, memorable acronym that solves the most common beginner blocker in video content creation.</i>\n🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DaazXLUINiv/\">Original reel</a>\n<i>#content-creation #personal-brand #social-media</i>",
    "markdown": "<b>FUEL Framework for Content Topics</b><br><i>The FUEL acronym gives content creators a ready-made framework for never running out of things to say on camera.</i><br>🔑 <b>Key points</b><br><ul><li>F — First person: your daily life, purchases, businesses, and thoughts are all content.</li><li>U — Unpopular: say the things your audience thinks but won&#x27;t say themselves — that&#x27;s how you stand out.</li><li>E — Experiences: mine past struggles, challenges, and ended friendships for lessons others can learn from.</li><li>L — Listen: once you&#x27;re posting, your comment section tells you exactly what topics to cover next.</li></ul><br>💾 <i>Compact, memorable acronym that solves the most common beginner blocker in video content creation.</i><br>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DaazXLUINiv/\">Original reel</a><br><i>#content-creation #personal-brand #social-media</i><details><summary>📄 Full transcript</summary>Short-form video teaching the FUEL framework: draw topics from your own life (First person), contrarian opinions (Unpopular), past hardships (Experiences), and audience questions (Listen).\n\nSo you want to start yapping to the camera and making thousands of dollars doing so, getting job opportunities, getting clothing brands to send you stuff, starting businesses off it, having a following. But you don&#x27;t know what the fuck to talk about. Well, it&#x27;s not actually that hard. And I came up with an acronym to save you hours and hours of time of wasting time in front of this camera. So here it is. It&#x27;s called FUEL. F-U-E-L. And I promise you this is a game changer. Starts off with F. First person. Your life is content. What you did today. What you&#x27;re building. What you talk. Who you talk to. Everything in your life is content. What kind of toothpaste you brush your teeth with. What kind of car you&#x27;re about to buy. What business you&#x27;re starting. Every single thought you have is content. That is number one. Number two, you. Unpopular. Your unpopular takes and the things you think but no one else wants to say are the way you&#x27;re going to stand out and win this game. Be the person people look up to because you&#x27;re willing to say stuff they think but won&#x27;t say. Experiences. You need to mind your past. You need to look for problems and struggles you went through. You need to look for trials and challenges that other people are also going through. You need to look at friendships you no longer have anymore and what you learned. You have to look at your past because this is experience that other people can gain value from. L. Listen. Once you start posting content, the questions that people have will be in your comments. And you have unlimited amounts of topics to talk about because you no longer need to think. Just look in your comments and your audience is there asking what they want to learn next. Follow for more because I&#x27;m going to teach you how to yap your fucking head off. Follow for more because I&#x27;m going to teach you how to yap your fucking head off.</details>",
    "platform": "instagram",
    "ts": "2026-07-06T17:42:50"
  },
