    "digest": "<b>9 Topics to Unrot Your Brain</b>\n\n📚 <b>Concepts</b>\n✅ <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gut%E2%80%93brain_axis\">Gut-Brain Axis</a>\n✅ <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neuroplasticity\">Neuroplasticity</a>\n✅ <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Microbiome\">Microbiome</a>\n✅ <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cognitive_bias\">Cognitive Biases</a>\n✅ <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Epigenetics\">Epigenetics</a>\n⚠️ <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Negative_feedback\">Hormonal Feedback Loops</a> — <i>No dedicated Wikipedia page for &#x27;hormonal feedback loops&#x27;; linked to Wikipedia&#x27;s &#x27;Negative feedback&#x27; article which covers the biological mechanism — see also Endocrine system for context</i>\n⚠️ <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sleep_cycle\">Sleep Architecture</a> — <i>Wikipedia&#x27;s &#x27;Sleep cycle&#x27; covers sleep architecture including NREM and REM stages; no confirmed standalone &#x27;Sleep architecture&#x27; Wikipedia article</i>\n✅ <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Decision_fatigue\">Decision Fatigue</a>\n✅ <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Placebo\">The Placebo Effect</a>\n\n💾 <i>Compact doctor-curated reference of 9 foundational biology and neuroscience concepts that explain the mechanisms behind mood, health, habits, and decision-making.</i>\n🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DaDwrtGEVih/\">Original reel</a>\n<i>#neuroscience #health #biology</i>",
