    "status": "done",
    "digest": "<b>5 Reel Topic Categories Framework</b>\n<i>Reels ideas fall into five topic categories that cover different audience needs and reach goals.</i>\n\n🔑 <b>Key points</b>\n• Personal topic\n• Expert topic\n• General topic\n• Trigger topic — designed for high reach\n• Topic that closes pain points of your target audience\n\n💾 <i>Compact five-category framework for generating Reel ideas that balance personal brand, authority, reach, and audience relevance.</i>\n🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Dacf-MpOCbm/\">Original reel</a>\n<i>#reels #content-strategy #smm</i>",
    "markdown": "<b>5 Reel Topic Categories Framework</b><br><i>Reels ideas fall into five topic categories that cover different audience needs and reach goals.</i><br>🔑 <b>Key points</b><br><ul><li>Personal topic</li><li>Expert topic</li><li>General topic</li><li>Trigger topic — designed for high reach</li><li>Topic that closes pain points of your target audience</li></ul><br>💾 <i>Compact five-category framework for generating Reel ideas that balance personal brand, authority, reach, and audience relevance.</i><br>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Dacf-MpOCbm/\">Original reel</a><br><i>#reels #content-strategy #smm</i><details><summary>📄 Full transcript</summary>The reel outlines five content topic categories to use when brainstorming Reel ideas — personal, expert, general, trigger for broad reach, and topics that address the target audience&#x27;s core pain points. Framed as a save-worthy checklist for content creators.\n\nТы просто обязана снять эти 50 идей для Reels. Сохранять, чтобы не потерять, а я рассказываю. Личная тема, экспертная тема, общая тема, триггерная тема для больших охватов. Тема, которая закрывает боли твоей целевой аудитории.</details>",
