  "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DYMMg5Evda5/": {
    "status": "done",
    "digest": "<b>Harness Neuroplasticity for Your Goals</b>\n<i>Neuroplasticity lets you intentionally rewire your neural pathways to achieve personal and professional goals by controlling your inputs and behaviors.</i>\n\n🔑 <b>Key points</b>\n• Eliminate negative self-talk, sad music, and self-destructive habits that don&#x27;t align with your goals\n• Shift from outcome-based to identity-based self-talk (e.g., &#x27;I&#x27;m a person who prioritises strength and nutrition&#x27;)\n• Habit stack: attach a new behavior to an existing one (e.g., pack your gym bag before sleep)\n• Mindful training: no phone or Instagram Reels during workouts\n\n💾 <i>Compact, actionable breakdown of neuroplasticity applied to identity-based thinking and deliberate habit formation.</i>\n🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DYMMg5Evda5/\">Original reel</a>\n<i>#neuroplasticity #mindset #habits</i>",
    "markdown": "<b>Harness Neuroplasticity for Your Goals</b><br><i>Neuroplasticity lets you intentionally rewire your neural pathways to achieve personal and professional goals by controlling your inputs and behaviors.</i><br>🔑 <b>Key points</b><br><ul><li>Eliminate negative self-talk, sad music, and self-destructive habits that don&#x27;t align with your goals</li><li>Shift from outcome-based to identity-based self-talk (e.g., &#x27;I&#x27;m a person who prioritises strength and nutrition&#x27;)</li><li>Habit stack: attach a new behavior to an existing one (e.g., pack your gym bag before sleep)</li><li>Mindful training: no phone or Instagram Reels during workouts</li></ul><br>💾 <i>Compact, actionable breakdown of neuroplasticity applied to identity-based thinking and deliberate habit formation.</i><br>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DYMMg5Evda5/\">Original reel</a><br><i>#neuroplasticity #mindset #habits</i><details><summary>📄 Full transcript</summary>The reel frames neuroplasticity as a tool for intentional self-change. Key techniques: eliminate negative inputs, shift to identity-based self-talk, stack new habits onto existing ones, and train without phone distractions.\n\nI don&#x27;t know who told you you couldn&#x27;t do it but you absolutely can. The thing you&#x27;ve been thinking about doing, I think you&#x27;ve planned enough. There is nothing in this world you can&#x27;t achieve with the power of neuroplasticity on your side. Neuroplasticity is a user or loser system. Harnessing neuroplasticity is akin to becoming the architect of your own mind. You can intentionally rewire your neural pathways to achieve your personal and professional goals. In short, this means no more sad music, no more negative self-talk, no more self-destructive behaviours and habits that don&#x27;t align with your goals. Shift from outcome-based self-talk to identity-based self-talk. I&#x27;m a person who prioritises strength and nutrition. You can also habit stack, but before I sleep, I&#x27;ll pack my gym bag for tomorrow. And mindful training, so whenever you&#x27;re working out, you don&#x27;t look at your phone and you don&#x27;t open Instagram reels. But yeah, whatever you&#x27;re thinking of, you can do it.</details>",
    "platform": "instagram",
    "ts": "2026-07-08T16:30:34"
  },
