    "digest": "“<b>playfulness over perfection, authenticity over optimization</b>”\n— olivianiemann\n\n<i>She invites her community by naming the themes she stands for — leaving corporate, abundance thinking, spiritual frameworks, and using content for self-expression rather than performance.</i>\n💡 <b>Use content as a tool for self-expression and visibility, not optimization.</b>\n\n💾 <i>Compact creator intro that shows how to use a values-and-topics list to attract a specific audience.</i>\n🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DagpJ9RR0xv/\">Original reel</a>\n<i>#authenticity #human-design #content-strategy</i>",
    "markdown": "“<b>playfulness over perfection, authenticity over optimization</b>”<br>— olivianiemann<br><i>She invites her community by naming the themes she stands for — leaving corporate, abundance thinking, spiritual frameworks, and using content for self-expression rather than performance.</i><br>💡 <b>Use content as a tool for self-expression and visibility, not optimization.</b><br>💾 <i>Compact creator intro that shows how to use a values-and-topics list to attract a specific audience.</i><br>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DagpJ9RR0xv/\">Original reel</a><br><i>#authenticity #human-design #content-strategy</i><details><summary>📄 Full transcript</summary>Liv introduces herself and her content niche by listing the spiritual and lifestyle topics she covers, framing her channel as a community for people drawn to authenticity, self-expression, and leaving the traditional corporate path.\n\nokay let me guess quitting your corporate job getting paid to exist joe dispensa abundance mindset astrology human design gene keys playfulness over perfection authenticity over optimization and using content for self-expression and visibility to create your dream life if you resonate with any of these topics hi my name&#x27;s liv and you found your freaking people welcome to the party</details>",
