    "status": "done",
    "digest": "<b>Adaptogenic Coffee Ad for Gut Health</b>\n\n📚 <b>Concepts</b>\n⚠️ <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inonotus_obliquus\">Chaga (Inonotus obliquus)</a> — <i>Wikipedia page for Inonotus obliquus inferred from NCBI sources naming it; direct Wikipedia URL not returned in search results.</i>\n✅ <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hericium_erinaceus\">Lion&#x27;s Mane (Hericium erinaceus)</a>\n✅ <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Theanine\">L-Theanine</a>\n✅ <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Collagen\">Collagen</a>\n\n💾 <i>Documents a viral-format sponsored reel for an adaptogenic coffee blend, useful for studying influencer product promotion tactics and the specific ingredient claims made.</i>\n🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Dal5H56AfPL/\">Original reel</a>\n<i>#adaptogens #gut-health #sponsored</i>",
    "markdown": "<b>Adaptogenic Coffee Ad for Gut Health</b><br>📚 <b>Concepts</b><br><ol><li>⚠️ <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inonotus_obliquus\">Chaga (Inonotus obliquus)</a> — <i>Wikipedia page for Inonotus obliquus inferred from NCBI sources naming it; direct Wikipedia URL not returned in search results.</i></li><li>✅ <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hericium_erinaceus\">Lion&#x27;s Mane (Hericium erinaceus)</a></li><li>✅ <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Theanine\">L-Theanine</a></li><li>✅ <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Collagen\">Collagen</a></li></ol><br>💾 <i>Documents a viral-format sponsored reel for an adaptogenic coffee blend, useful for studying influencer product promotion tactics and the specific ingredient claims made.</i><br>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Dal5H56AfPL/\">Original reel</a><br><i>#adaptogens #gut-health #sponsored</i><details><summary>📄 Full transcript</summary>Creator lists common gut and energy complaints, attributes them to a missing ingredient, and pitches an adaptogenic coffee blend as the fix. Product is a 30-serving bag ($45 retail) with a 40% discount, free starter kit, and free shipping available via the video link. Classic influencer ad format with urgency trigger (sells out fast).\n\nIf your chin looks like that, your pooch looks like that, and your poop looks like this, you have the bowling ball face, the hip titties, your farts really stink, and you bloat from eating something as small as a banana. You better listen because all of those issues are rooted in a much deeper problem. But they are all pretty common and it&#x27;s not because you&#x27;re eating foods like this. And it&#x27;s definitely not because you&#x27;re not working out. The reality is you simply just need to give your body what it needs. And it&#x27;s as easy as having one scoop of this coffee every morning. When you start drinking this coffee, you may just notice you&#x27;re not craving sugar anymore, you&#x27;re not as bloated, your poops are more consistent, your energy&#x27;s lasting all day, and you&#x27;re sleeping a whole lot better. And it&#x27;s all thanks to the powerful adaptogenic ingredients inside of this blend. It&#x27;s got chaga to help reduce your bloating, collagen protein to strengthen your skin barrier, lion&#x27;s mane to reduce brain fog and improve your memory and focus, L-theanine to help lower stress, and low acidity coffee to give you smooth, long lasting energy without wrecking your gut. But I keep seeing people make a huge mistake when they buy this coffee. So many people are paying $45 for the one bag when they could be getting 40% off this same 30 serving bag, plus a free VIP starter kit and free shipping when they click the link that&#x27;s on this video. So if you deal with any of those issues, I highly recommend picking up this coffee while it&#x27;s on sale. Bear warning, when these sales happen, the coffee sells out fast, so be quick.</details>",
