    "digest": "<b>Instagram Profile &amp; Reels Formula</b>\n<i>A formula-based system for optimizing every layer of an Instagram profile — bio, pinned posts, post templates, audience targeting, headlines, and Reel hooks.</i>\n\n🔑 <b>Key points</b>\n• Profile bio is written using a specific formula\n• Pinned posts follow a defined structure\n• Regular posts and pinned posts use a set template\n• Target audience is identified through a specific AI prompt\n• Headlines are built from a ready-made template\n• The first 3 seconds of a Reel are the most critical for audience retention\n• Hooks are required to ensure Reels reach a larger audience\n• Comment &#x27;100&#x27; under the video to receive the author&#x27;s list of 100 verified hooks\n\n💾 <i>Packages a complete Instagram content system — bio, posts, audience, headlines, and hooks — into one reusable framework.</i>\n🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DbEXdy3ixDG/\">Original reel</a>\n<i>#instagram #content-strategy #hooks</i>",
    "markdown": "<b>Instagram Profile &amp; Reels Formula</b><br><i>A formula-based system for optimizing every layer of an Instagram profile — bio, pinned posts, post templates, audience targeting, headlines, and Reel hooks.</i><br>🔑 <b>Key points</b><br><ul><li>Profile bio is written using a specific formula</li><li>Pinned posts follow a defined structure</li><li>Regular posts and pinned posts use a set template</li><li>Target audience is identified through a specific AI prompt</li><li>Headlines are built from a ready-made template</li><li>The first 3 seconds of a Reel are the most critical for audience retention</li><li>Hooks are required to ensure Reels reach a larger audience</li><li>Comment &#x27;100&#x27; under the video to receive the author&#x27;s list of 100 verified hooks</li></ul><br>💾 <i>Packages a complete Instagram content system — bio, posts, audience, headlines, and hooks — into one reusable framework.</i><br>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DbEXdy3ixDG/\">Original reel</a><br><i>#instagram #content-strategy #hooks</i><details><summary>📄 Full transcript</summary>Quick-tip reel outlining a full Instagram setup and growth formula: a bio formula, pinned post structure, post and pinned templates, a target audience prompt, headline templates, and hook usage in the first 3 seconds of Reels. Ends with a CTA to comment &#x27;100&#x27; for a 100-hook swipe file.\n\nГотовься делать скрины. Шапка профиля пишется вот по такой формуле. Закрепы мы делаем вот так. Посты и закрепы делаем вот так. Определить свою целевую аудиторию ты сможешь благодаря этому промпту. Вот такой шаблон забирай для заголовков. Но чтобы твои рилс наверняка залетали и охватывали большее количество аудитории, тебе нужно использовать хуки. На первые 3 секунды самые важные в ваших рилс. Чтобы забрать список из 100 проверенных хуков, напиши мне 100 в комментарии.</details>",
