    "status": "done",
    "digest": "<b>200 Reel Ideas by Category</b>\n\n📌 <b>Recommended</b>\n<i>Not clear from the Reel.</i>\n\n💾 <i>Ready-to-use bank of 80 fill-in-the-blank Reel title templates covering hooks, tips, tutorials, and storytelling — eliminates content ideation from scratch.</i>\n🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Da-o7dskY4L/\">Original reel</a>\n<i>#content-ideas #reels #instagram-growth</i>",
    "markdown": "<b>200 Reel Ideas by Category</b><br>📌 <b>Recommended</b><br><ol><li><i>Not clear from the Reel.</i></li></ol><br>💾 <i>Ready-to-use bank of 80 fill-in-the-blank Reel title templates covering hooks, tips, tutorials, and storytelling — eliminates content ideation from scratch.</i><br>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Da-o7dskY4L/\">Original reel</a><br><i>#content-ideas #reels #instagram-growth</i><details><summary>📄 Full transcript</summary>80 plug-and-play Reel title templates organized into four categories. Each prompt uses __ as a niche placeholder so any creator can adapt it to their topic instantly.\n\n<b>Slide 1</b> — <i>Cover slide with handwritten blue text on white paper background</i>\n200 Reel ideas so you never run out of content\n\n<b>Slide 2</b> — <i>Slide listing 20 fill-in-the-blank hook opener templates for the first 2 seconds of a Reel</i>\nInstant Hooks\n(Use these to capture attention in the first 2 seconds)\n\n• &quot;Everyone told me this wouldn&#x27;t work... until it did.&quot;\n• &quot;If you&#x27;re new to __, you need to hear this.&quot;\n• &quot;This is the truth no one tells you about __.&quot;\n• &quot;I made this mistake for months — don&#x27;t do the same.&quot;\n• &quot;This small change completely transformed my results.&quot;\n• &quot;You&#x27;re probably doing __ wrong (and don&#x27;t even realize it).&quot;\n• &quot;I thought I&#x27;d be stuck in __ forever until I tried this.&quot;\n• &quot;I wish someone had told me this before starting __.&quot;\n• &quot;If you feel lost in __, this is what helped me.&quot;\n• &quot;Why your __ isn&#x27;t working (and how to fix it).&quot;\n• &quot;This simple adjustment in my routine changed everything.&quot;\n• &quot;Why I almost quit __ (but didn&#x27;t).&quot;\n• &quot;The advice I ignored for years — and I regret it.&quot;\n• &quot;Everyone complicates __ too much. This is the real secret.&quot;\n• &quot;What I was silently ruining my progress in __.&quot;\n• &quot;This underestimated tip knocked __ out of the park overnight.&quot;\n• &quot;The myth about __ that keeps most people stuck.&quot;\n• &quot;If you&#x27;re doing __, do this instead.&quot;\n• &quot;No one told me __ was going to be this difficult.&quot;\n• &quot;I tried 3 strategies for __ — this is what really worked.&quot;\n\n<b>Slide 3</b> — <i>Slide listing 20 numbered fill-in-the-blank tips/tools/hacks Reel title templates</i>\nTips, Tools and Hacks\n(Practical value that generates saves and shares)\n\n1. &quot;5 small habits that improved my __ instantly.&quot;\n2. &quot;The 10-minute routine that changed how I approach __.&quot;\n3. &quot;This app completely simplified my __ process.&quot;\n4. &quot;3 tools for beginners I use daily for __.&quot;\n5. &quot;The checklist I follow before every __.&quot;\n6. &quot;The lazy way I organize my __ (but it works).&quot;\n7. &quot;How to cut your __ time in half without losing quality.&quot;\n8. &quot;My step-by-step system to stay consistent with __.&quot;\n9. &quot;The easiest way to measure progress in __.&quot;\n10. &quot;If you always forget __, try this.&quot;\n11. &quot;My underrated favorite tool for creators doing __.&quot;\n12. &quot;Stop overcomplicating __. Here you have a simple approach.&quot;\n13. &quot;The setup I use to record/edit/create __.&quot;\n14. &quot;The shortcut that saves me time when I do __.&quot;\n15. &quot;How I automated part of my __ process.&quot;\n16. &quot;The hack that helps me stay focused on __.&quot;\n17. &quot;3 mistakes that made my __ harder than necessary.&quot;\n18. &quot;The productivity trick I swear by when doing __.&quot;\n19. &quot;How I plan a week of __ content in 1 hour.&quot;\n20. &quot;The formula I use every time I create __.&quot;\n\n<b>Slide 4</b> — <i>Slide listing 20 numbered beginner and how-to Reel title templates emphasizing teaching and simplification</i>\nBeginners and How-To\n(Teaching + simplifying = authority)\n\n1. &quot;How to start __ without getting overwhelmed.&quot;\n2. &quot;The beginner&#x27;s guide I wish I had when I started __.&quot;\n3. &quot;The 3-step method I use to simplify __.&quot;\n4. &quot;How I plan my entire __ process from start to finish.&quot;\n5. &quot;My exact workflow for __ (you can copy it).&quot;\n6. &quot;How to build a habit around __ that actually sticks.&quot;\n7. &quot;The mistake every beginner makes in __.&quot;\n8. &quot;How to stay consistent with __ without burnout.&quot;\n9. &quot;The 5 things I wish I&#x27;d known before starting __.&quot;\n10. &quot;How to get faster results in __ using this method.&quot;\n11. &quot;How to fix your __ routine once and for all.&quot;\n12. &quot;The tools I use daily to make __ easier.&quot;\n13. &quot;How I organize my week to stay consistent with __.&quot;\n14. &quot;The biggest trap for beginners in __ and how to avoid it.&quot;\n15. &quot;How to plan your first __ like a professional.&quot;\n16. &quot;How to build your first __ system.&quot;\n17. &quot;My simple way to track progress in __.&quot;\n18. &quot;The skill that makes everything in __ much easier.&quot;\n19. &quot;How to bounce back when you fail at __.&quot;\n20. &quot;How to start __ even without experience.&quot;\n\n<b>Slide 5</b> — <i>Slide listing 20 fill-in-the-blank storytelling and mindset Reel title templates for personal connection</i>\nStorytelling and Mindset\n(Show your human side. Connect deeper)\n\n• &quot;When I started __, I had no idea what I was doing.&quot;\n• &quot;This failure in __ taught me more than any success.&quot;\n• &quot;I used to think __ was selfish — now I see it as self-care.&quot;\n• &quot;This is what I learned by doing __ every day for 30 days.&quot;\n• &quot;I wish I had known this about __ before starting.&quot;\n• &quot;The day I almost quit __, but didn&#x27;t.&quot;\n• &quot;My biggest revelation after months of __.&quot;\n• &quot;How I manage burnout while doing __.&quot;\n• &quot;The hardest lesson about __ starting (not what people think).&quot;\n• &quot;I thought __ would make me happy. I was wrong.&quot;\n• &quot;Why I stopped chasing perfection in __.&quot;\n• &quot;How I turned my worst moment into motivation for __.&quot;\n• &quot;This mindset shift changed everything in __.&quot;\n• &quot;This is what real progress in __ actually looks like.&quot;\n• &quot;No one talks about how lonely __ can feel sometimes.&quot;\n• &quot;How __ helped me rebuild my confidence.&quot;\n• &quot;What I learned about patience by doing __.&quot;\n• &quot;How I found my purpose through __.&quot;\n• &quot;The lesson that completely changed how I see __.&quot;\n• &quot;What I tell myself when I want to give up on __.&quot;\n\n<b>Slide 6</b> — <i>Call-to-action slide with handwritten blue text on white paper background</i>\nComment &quot;X&quot; for more prompts and an IG growth guide</details>",
