    "status": "done",
    "digest": "<b>Build Forbes-Like Media for Free</b>\n<i>“Don&#x27;t pay $5,000 a year to just get featured.”</i>\n\n🪜 <b>How to</b>\n1. Spin up a social media blog/media account in any niche\n2. Find influencers on the platform and DM them using an AI agent with one of three prompt templates (Casual, Short &amp; Sweet, Fan Angle), offering a free feature\n3. Once someone agrees, take their top performing post and run it through an AI writing humanizer repo to produce a humanized article\n4. Feed the article into a carousel GitHub repo with Nano Banana Pro to generate a 7-slide carousel at 1080x1350\n5. Post the article and carousel; use Instagram&#x27;s &#x27;Invite Collaborators&#x27; option (under Tag People) to add the influencer as co-author — up to 3 collaborators per post\n6. Repeat at scale until the account grows large enough to land brand deals or hire a creative director\n\n<i>Useful for: Anyone who wants to build a credible media brand using AI agents instead of paying for paid press placements like Forbes Councils.</i>\n\n💾 <i>Concrete AI agent blueprint for building a credible media brand by featuring influencers for free, with specific GitHub repos, DM prompt templates, and carousel generation steps.</i>\n🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DbI0-guRspT/\">Original reel</a>\n<i>#ai-agent #media-building #content-automation</i>",
    "markdown": "<b>Build Forbes-Like Media for Free</b><br><i>“Don&#x27;t pay $5,000 a year to just get featured.”</i><br>🪜 <b>How to</b><br><ol><li>Spin up a social media blog/media account in any niche</li><li>Find influencers on the platform and DM them using an AI agent with one of three prompt templates (Casual, Short &amp; Sweet, Fan Angle), offering a free feature</li><li>Once someone agrees, take their top performing post and run it through an AI writing humanizer repo to produce a humanized article</li><li>Feed the article into a carousel GitHub repo with Nano Banana Pro to generate a 7-slide carousel at 1080x1350</li><li>Post the article and carousel; use Instagram&#x27;s &#x27;Invite Collaborators&#x27; option (under Tag People) to add the influencer as co-author — up to 3 collaborators per post</li><li>Repeat at scale until the account grows large enough to land brand deals or hire a creative director</li></ol><br><i>Useful for: Anyone who wants to build a credible media brand using AI agents instead of paying for paid press placements like Forbes Councils.</i><br>💾 <i>Concrete AI agent blueprint for building a credible media brand by featuring influencers for free, with specific GitHub repos, DM prompt templates, and carousel generation steps.</i><br>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DbI0-guRspT/\">Original reel</a><br><i>#ai-agent #media-building #content-automation</i><details><summary>📄 Full transcript</summary>Step-by-step tutorial on using AI agents to build a media/blog account: cold-DM influencers with template prompts, convert their top posts into humanized articles via GitHub repos, publish 7-slide carousels generated with Nano Banana Pro, and use Instagram&#x27;s Invite Collaborators feature for co-authorship reach — bypassing the $5,000/yr Forbes pay-to-play model.\n\nForbes just bamboozled all of us. You ever seen an Instagram account that looks like this, says like, as seen on Forbes? You wonder, how did this guy get into Forbes? He paid the money. That&#x27;s how Forbes makes $300 million a year. Welcome back to, wait, can we just build this ourselves? Spin up a series of social media accounts. Find a bunch of influencers that you think are cool on one of these platforms. Then DM them being like, yo, I got like a blog and shit. Let me give you a feature. And yeah, you could just have an AI agent do all that. Just like give it this prompt or something. Eventually somebody will be like, sure buddy, that&#x27;s fine. Wait, don&#x27;t be like Forbes and charge the money. That&#x27;s so cringe. Instead, take one of these writing humanizer GitHub repositories and choose one of the influencers high performing posts. Give your AI agent this prompt. It will take that top post and write it as a humanized article. Now install one of these repositories that specialize in creating Instagram carousel. Next prompt, it will create a series of Instagram carousels based on the article. Angus AI is so bad at making content. How do I make it good? I haven&#x27;t figured that part out yet. I&#x27;m sorry, bro. Now you have your article and your carousels. Give those puppies a post. Try to get the influencer to like collab with you on the post. They&#x27;ll probably reject you, but worth a try. And then just keep doing that over and over and over again until you&#x27;re big enough to land brand deals. Maybe even hire a creative director to create actually good content. Congratulations, you are now basically the next four. Don&#x27;t pay $5,000 a year to just get featured. Follow your boy instead. I&#x27;ll show you how to build cool stuff like this for free.</details>",
    "blocks": {
