  "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DYXEB6bxgxo/": {
    "status": "done",
    "digest": "“<b>We only created gyms because the Industrial Revolution made it possible to live a life without physical exertion.</b>”\n— bitterbuilds\n\n<i>Just as the Industrial Revolution made physical effort optional and gyms compensated, the AI revolution is making mental effort optional — so deliberate reading, writing, and AI fluency will become the equivalent compensation.</i>\n💡 <b>Reading and writing are the mental gym of the AI era.</b>\n\n💾 <i>A compact, memorable analogy for why deliberate cognitive habits will become more valuable — not less — as AI automates thinking.</i>\n🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DYXEB6bxgxo/\">Original reel</a>\n<i>#ai #reading #cognitive-fitness</i>",
    "markdown": "“<b>We only created gyms because the Industrial Revolution made it possible to live a life without physical exertion.</b>”<br>— bitterbuilds<br><i>Just as the Industrial Revolution made physical effort optional and gyms compensated, the AI revolution is making mental effort optional — so deliberate reading, writing, and AI fluency will become the equivalent compensation.</i><br>💡 <b>Reading and writing are the mental gym of the AI era.</b><br>💾 <i>A compact, memorable analogy for why deliberate cognitive habits will become more valuable — not less — as AI automates thinking.</i><br>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DYXEB6bxgxo/\">Original reel</a><br><i>#ai #reading #cognitive-fitness</i><details><summary>📄 Full transcript</summary>The Industrial Revolution made physical exertion optional, so we built gyms. AI is making cognitive exertion optional — reading, writing, and AI fluency are the mental equivalent people will need to deliberately practice.\n\nI read a really interesting quote the other day that said, we only created gyms because the Industrial Revolution made it possible to live a life without physical exertion. And now, because the AI revolution is making it possible to live a life without cognitive or mental exertion, we need the mental equivalent of gyms. This is exactly why I think reading and writing are going to become so important in the coming decades. This is, of course, in addition to AI fluency.</details>",
    "blocks": {
      "blocks": [
