    "digest": "<b>10 Things Founders Should Post</b>\n<i>Founders should post about their real thinking, decisions, and behind-the-scenes reality — not just achievements — because audiences follow journeys, not brands.</i>\n\n🔑 <b>Key points</b>\n• What you believe your industry gets wrong\n• A problem you&#x27;re currently trying to solve\n• A decision you made and why you made it\n• A mistake that changed how you operate\n• Something a customer said that stuck with you\n• The part of the business nobody gets to see\n• What you refuse to compromise on\n• Your honest opinion of an industry trend\n• Proof of how you think, not just what you achieved\n• Where you&#x27;re trying to take the company next\n\n💾 <i>Concrete list of 10 founder content angles that build personal brand by showing thinking and journey rather than outcomes.</i>\n🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DbGwmecqr-l/\">Original reel</a>\n<i>#founder #content #personal-brand</i>",
