  "https://x.com/uselegion/status/2081743644793700595": {
    "status": "done",
    "digest": "<b>11 Funding Programs for Young Founders</b>\n\n📌 <b>Recommended</b>\n✅ <a href=\"https://thielfellowship.org/\">Thiel Fellowship</a> — Thiel Foundation\n✅ <a href=\"https://www.1517fund.com/\">1517 Fund</a> — Michael Gibson, Danielle Strachman\n✅ <a href=\"https://neo.com/\">Neo</a> — Ali Partovi\n✅ <a href=\"https://www.zfellows.com/\">Z Fellows</a>\n✅ <a href=\"https://www.dormroomfund.com/\">Dorm Room Fund</a> — First Round Capital\n✅ <a href=\"https://pear.vc/programs/dorm/competition/\">Pear Competition</a> — Pear VC\n✅ <a href=\"https://www.generalcatalyst.com/stories/introducing-the-gc-venture-fellowship\">GC Venture Fellows</a> — General Catalyst\n✅ <a href=\"https://www.mercatus.org/emergent-ventures\">Emergent Ventures</a> — Tyler Cowen / Mercatus Center\n✅ <a href=\"https://776.org/\">776 Fellowship</a> — Alexis Ohanian / 776 Foundation\n✅ <a href=\"https://www.ycombinator.com/early-decision\">YC Early Decision</a> — Y Combinator\n✅ <a href=\"https://f.inc/\">Founders, Inc.</a>\n\n💾 <i>A rare single-source compilation of early-stage funding programs for founders under 25, with real check sizes, equity terms, and eligibility in one place.</i>\n🔗 <a href=\"https://x.com/uselegion/status/2081743644793700595\">Original reel</a>\n<i>#funding #student-founders #fellowships</i>",
    "markdown": "<b>11 Funding Programs for Young Founders</b><br>📌 <b>Recommended</b><br><ol><li>✅ <a href=\"https://thielfellowship.org/\">Thiel Fellowship</a> — Thiel Foundation</li><li>✅ <a href=\"https://www.1517fund.com/\">1517 Fund</a> — Michael Gibson, Danielle Strachman</li><li>✅ <a href=\"https://neo.com/\">Neo</a> — Ali Partovi</li><li>✅ <a href=\"https://www.zfellows.com/\">Z Fellows</a></li><li>✅ <a href=\"https://www.dormroomfund.com/\">Dorm Room Fund</a> — First Round Capital</li><li>✅ <a href=\"https://pear.vc/programs/dorm/competition/\">Pear Competition</a> — Pear VC</li><li>✅ <a href=\"https://www.generalcatalyst.com/stories/introducing-the-gc-venture-fellowship\">GC Venture Fellows</a> — General Catalyst</li><li>✅ <a href=\"https://www.mercatus.org/emergent-ventures\">Emergent Ventures</a> — Tyler Cowen / Mercatus Center</li><li>✅ <a href=\"https://776.org/\">776 Fellowship</a> — Alexis Ohanian / 776 Foundation</li><li>✅ <a href=\"https://www.ycombinator.com/early-decision\">YC Early Decision</a> — Y Combinator</li><li>✅ <a href=\"https://f.inc/\">Founders, Inc.</a></li></ol><br>💾 <i>A rare single-source compilation of early-stage funding programs for founders under 25, with real check sizes, equity terms, and eligibility in one place.</i><br>🔗 <a href=\"https://x.com/uselegion/status/2081743644793700595\">Original reel</a><br><i>#funding #student-founders #fellowships</i><details><summary>📄 Full transcript</summary>Legion compiled 11 ways young founders (students and dropouts) can get funded: Thiel Fellowship ($250K), 1517 Fund (up to $1M), Neo ($25K equity-free), Z Fellows ($10K at $1B cap), Dorm Room Fund, Pear Competition ($100K uncapped SAFE), GC Venture Fellows ($25K), Emergent Ventures (worldwide grants from age 13), 776 Fellowship ($100K, climate only), YC Early Decision ($500K, no dropout required), and Founders Inc (up to $250K summer program).</details>",
    "blocks": {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "size": 1,
          "text": "11 Funding Programs for Young Founders"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "size": 3,
          "text": "📌 Recommended"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": [
                    "✅ ",
                    {
                      "type": "url",
                      "text": "Thiel Fellowship",
                      "url": "https://thielfellowship.org/"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "italic",
                      "text": " — Thiel Foundation"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "italic",
                      "text": " · Official site confirmed. $250K over two years to build instead of finishing a degree. Notable alumni: Vitalik Buterin, Dylan Field (Figma), Austin Russell (Luminar)."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": [
                    "✅ ",
                    {
                      "type": "url",
                      "text": "1517 Fund",
                      "url": "https://www.1517fund.com/"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "italic",
                      "text": " — Michael Gibson, Danielle Strachman"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "italic",
                      "text": " · Official site confirmed. $175M fund for dropouts and students. $50K at idea stage, up to $1M. First check into Loom."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": [
                    "✅ ",
                    {
                      "type": "url",
                      "text": "Neo",
                      "url": "https://neo.com/"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "italic",
                      "text": " — Ali Partovi"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "italic",
                      "text": " · Official site confirmed. ~30 students/year, $25K equity-free, gap semester to build in SF. Scholar Michael Truell later founded Cursor."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": [
                    "✅ ",
                    {
                      "type": "url",
                      "text": "Z Fellows",
                      "url": "https://www.zfellows.com/"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "italic",
                      "text": " · Official site confirmed. $10K for one week, invested at $1B cap. High schoolers eligible, no need to quit school. Alumni include Cursor, Cognition, and Etched founders."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": [
                    "✅ ",
                    {
                      "type": "url",
                      "text": "Dorm Room Fund",
                      "url": "https://www.dormroomfund.com/"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "italic",
                      "text": " — First Round Capital"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "italic",
                      "text": " · Official site confirmed. Student-run preseed fund. Post says $40K checks; site now lists $90K–$250K, likely updated since post. Need at least one enrolled founder or within one year of graduating."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": [
                    "✅ ",
                    {
                      "type": "url",
                      "text": "Pear Competition",
                      "url": "https://pear.vc/programs/dorm/competition/"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "italic",
                      "text": " — Pear VC"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "italic",
                      "text": " · Official Pear VC competition page confirmed. $100K on an uncapped SAFE, runs every semester. Open to any US or Canadian student at idea stage."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": [
                    "✅ ",
                    {
                      "type": "url",
                      "text": "GC Venture Fellows",
                      "url": "https://www.generalcatalyst.com/stories/introducing-the-gc-venture-fellowship"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "italic",
                      "text": " — General Catalyst"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "italic",
                      "text": " · Official General Catalyst page confirmed. Formerly Rough Draft Ventures. $25K first checks sourced by 20 student fellows across campuses. Portfolio has raised $4B+."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": [
                    "✅ ",
                    {
                      "type": "url",
                      "text": "Emergent Ventures",
                      "url": "https://www.mercatus.org/emergent-ventures"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "italic",
                      "text": " — Tyler Cowen / Mercatus Center"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "italic",
                      "text": " · Official Mercatus Center page confirmed. Tyler Cowen personally reads applications from anyone 13+, worldwide. Over 1,000 grants awarded."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": [
                    "✅ ",
                    {
                      "type": "url",
                      "text": "776 Fellowship",
                      "url": "https://776.org/"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "italic",
                      "text": " — Alexis Ohanian / 776 Foundation"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "italic",
                      "text": " · Official 776 Foundation site confirmed. $100K over two years, ages 18–24, climate-focused projects only."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": [
                    "✅ ",
                    {
                      "type": "url",
                      "text": "YC Early Decision",
                      "url": "https://www.ycombinator.com/early-decision"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "italic",
                      "text": " — Y Combinator"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "italic",
                      "text": " · Official YC page confirmed. Apply while still in school, receive $500K investment, defer the batch until after graduation. No dropout required."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": [
                    "✅ ",
                    {
                      "type": "url",
                      "text": "Founders, Inc.",
                      "url": "https://f.inc/"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "italic",
                      "text": " · Official site confirmed. Six-week summer program at Fort Mason, SF. Top teams receive up to $250K. Open to students and recent grads."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "💾 A rare single-source compilation of early-stage funding programs for founders under 25, with real check sizes, equity terms, and eligibility in one place."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": [
            {
              "type": "url",
              "text": "🔗 Original reel",
              "url": "https://x.com/uselegion/status/2081743644793700595"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "details",
          "summary": "📄 Full transcript",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Legion compiled 11 ways young founders (students and dropouts) can get funded: Thiel Fellowship ($250K), 1517 Fund (up to $1M), Neo ($25K equity-free), Z Fellows ($10K at $1B cap), Dorm Room Fund, Pear Competition ($100K uncapped SAFE), GC Venture Fellows ($25K), Emergent Ventures (worldwide grants from age 13), 776 Fellowship ($100K, climate only), YC Early Decision ($500K, no dropout required), and Founders Inc (up to $250K summer program)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "text": "#funding #student-founders #fellowships"
        }
      ]
    },
    "platform": "twitter",
    "ts": "2026-08-11T01:05:29"
  },
