    "digest": "<b>5 YC Alternatives Open Now</b>\n<i>“Missing YC is not missing your shot.”</i>\n\n📌 <b>Recommended</b>\n✅ <a href=\"https://elbowgrease.cc/\">Elbow Grease</a> — Gutter Capital\n✅ <a href=\"https://www.character.vc/labs\">Character Labs</a> — Character Capital\n⚠️ <a href=\"https://x.com/mtndao\">mtnDAO Startup Residency</a> — mtnDAO — <i>No standalone website found; linked to official X account. 1-month residency for frontier tech founders, 24/7 workspace, demo day with investors. Deadline: Aug 31.</i>\n✅ <a href=\"https://r3sidency.fabric.vc/\">R[3]sidency</a> — Fabric Ventures\n✅ <a href=\"https://www.southparkcommons.com/news/f26-founder-fellowship/\">SPC Founder Fellowship Fall 2026</a> — South Park Commons\n\n💾 <i>A curated shortlist of lesser-known accelerators with verified terms and deadlines — useful reference for any pre-seed founder who missed YC.</i>\n🔗 <a href=\"https://x.com/kseniam0s/status/2081798826134814892\">Original reel</a>\n<i>#accelerator #startup #funding</i>",
