                      "url": "https://direct.mit.edu/octo/article/doi/10.1162/OCTO.a.545/137249/Latent-Spaces-AI-Art-and-the-Archive"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "italic",
                      "text": " — Antonio Somaini"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "italic",
                      "text": " · Published in October journal (MIT Press); referred to in the reel as 'A Theory of Latent Spaces.'"
                    }
                  ]
