    "digest": "<b>20 Under-the-Radar LA Family Offices</b>\n<i>“Los Angeles is not just an entertainment capital. It&#x27;s one of the most quietly wealthy cities in the world.”</i>\n\n📌 <b>Recommended</b>\n✅ <a href=\"https://www.athletefamilyoffice.com/\">AWM Capital (The Athlete Family Office)</a>\n✅ <a href=\"https://www.whittiertrust.com/\">Whittier Trust</a>\n✅ <a href=\"https://horowitzgroup.com/\">Horowitz Group</a>\n✅ <a href=\"https://zhang.vc/\">Zhang Capital</a> — Henry Zhang\n⚠️ <a href=\"https://www.crunchbase.com/organization/harlow-family-office\">Harlow Family Office</a> — <i>No official website found; Crunchbase profile confirms LA-based SFO at 8020 Melrose Ave.</i>\n✅ <a href=\"https://www.doradopeak.com/\">Dorado Peak Capital</a>\n✅ <a href=\"https://mehtaventures.co/\">Mehta Ventures Family Office</a>\n✅ <a href=\"https://koseiadvisors.com/\">Kosei Advisors</a>\n✅ <a href=\"https://galwayfamilyoffice.com/\">Galway Family Office</a>\n✅ <a href=\"http://www.prideco.com/\">PrideCo Capital</a>\n✅ <a href=\"https://www.clauseninc.com/\">Clausen Enterprises</a>\n✅ <a href=\"https://www.linepointpartners.com/\">LinePoint Partners</a>\n✅ <a href=\"https://www.excellent-capital.com/\">Excellent Capital</a> — Simon Zhang\n⚠️ <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/jesterschilder_40-family-offices-in-los-angeles-excellent-activity-7487456212968624129-e_mu\">Exodus Capital Holdings</a> — <i>No official website or LinkedIn company page found; appears in multiple LA family office lists alongside others from this post.</i>\n⚠️ <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/jackqkurtz\">Kurtosis LLC</a> — Jack Kurtz — <i>No official website; founded 2024 in Los Angeles, SFO for founder Jack Kurtz, per advizorpro profile.</i>\n⚠️ <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/inemu-private-investments\">iNemu Private Investments</a> — <i>No official website found; LinkedIn describes it as a private SFO focused on long-term wealth preservation and portfolio management.</i>\n