    "digest": "<b>AI content-maxx workflow</b>\n<i>“Use AI to speed up your content creation process instead of replacing your creativity altogether.”</i>\n\n🪜 <b>How to</b>\n1. Get content ideas from long-form content, not short-form\n2. Pick one high-performing format you can make every day\n3. Find a creator who does that format well; scroll their page for outlier videos (3–5× views vs follower count)\n4. Copy the outlier video&#x27;s link and paste it into Stanley; prompt it to transcribe and break down why the video performed\n5. Use a prompt to templatize that video&#x27;s structure\n6. Save the high-performing format to Stanley&#x27;s memory for future reuse\n7. Using your idea, format, and analysis, write a rough script in the same chat\n8. Ask Stanley to refine it into a final polished, high-performing script\n9. Film the video\n10. Repurpose the video into a carousel using Stanley&#x27;s carousel generator\n11. Repurpose relevant video scripts into platform-appropriate written content for X and LinkedIn\n\n<i>Useful for: Creators and founders who want a repeatable AI-assisted system to ideate, script, and repurpose content across platforms.</i>\n\n💾 <i>Complete step-by-step AI content workflow from a 170k+ creator, with Stanley as the central tool for reverse-engineering outlier videos, scripting, carousel generation, and cross-platform repurposing.</i>\n🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Db6NPsWxzOZ/\">Original reel</a>\n<i>#content-creation #ai-workflow #repurposing</i>",
