an make every day. Find a content creator that produces this content format very well. Scroll on their page and find outlier videos that have three to five times the amount of views compared to their follower count. Copy that video&#x27;s link and paste it into an AI built for content like Stanley. Ask you to transcribe and break down what made this video do well using this prompt. Using this analysis, templatize this video using this prompt. Now add this high performing content format to the AI&#x27;s memory to use for later. Now using your idea, content format and analysis, write out a rough script. Paste it in the same chat that you just used and get a final high performing content script. Now actually make this into a video that has a higher likelihood of performing well. Then repurpose this video into a carousel using Stanley&#x27;s carousel generator using this prompt. And finally, if you&#x27;re a founder and entrepreneur who has a mature audience, repurpose your relevant video scripts from Instagram, into platform appropriate written content for X and LinkedIn. Stanley has access to all your video and written content to sustainably create content that sounds like you. Congratulations. You now know how to use AI to speed up your content creation process instead of replacing your creativity altogether. Hope this helps.</details>",
