              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Cities are good for exactly two things: making money and finding a partner — once both are achieved, leave."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "High cost of living = a premium for social club access (bars, restaurants, people) that you pay whether you use it or not."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "The trap: many people work hard to afford the city another month, which lets them work hard to afford the city another month."
                }
              ]
            }
