    "digest": "<b>Develop an Insane Memory</b>\n<i>Use the Memory Palace technique — mentally placing information into vivid imagined scenes you move through — to retain what you learn far more effectively.</i>\n\n🔑 <b>Key points</b>\n• The Memory Palace works by associating pieces of information with specific locations inside a familiar imagined space, then retrieving them by mentally walking through that space\n• Consuming learning content in small, repeatable doses (as shown via Deepstash) reinforces the retention the Memory Palace builds\n\n💾 <i>Practical intro to the Memory Palace technique plus a tool recommendation (Deepstash) for anyone trying to actually retain what they learn.</i>\n🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DaG9j2uSRLY/\">Original reel</a>\n<i>#memory #memory-palace #learning</i>",
