    "digest": "<b>3 Ways to Master Anything</b>\n<i>Three strategies to excel at anything: meta-learning, cognitive optimization (sleep and nutrition), and active podcast retention using tools like Snipd.</i>\n\n🔑 <b>Key points</b>\n• Meta-learning: get good at getting good — the faster you acquire new skills, the more versatile you become across domains\n• Optimize cognition: adequate sleep and nutrition are prerequisites that allow your skill-learning capacity to be optimized\n• Remember better: the average podcast listener forgets 90% of an episode within the first 48 hours — use tools to actively extract and retain insights\n\n💾 <i>Clean 3-step framework for mastering any skill, plus a specific tool (Snipd) that fixes the podcast-retention gap.</i>\n🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DaO9loyuVF_/\">Original reel</a>\n<i>#meta-learning #snipd #podcasts</i>",
