          "text": "How to Be Successful"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": [
            {
              "type": "italic",
              "text": "Outlier success comes from compounding your career exponentially, holding near-delusional self-belief balanced by truth-seeking, and combining hard work, risk-taking, and relentless willfulness."
