    "digest": "<b>Claude + Metricool: Social Media Autopilot</b>\n<i>“Самое крутое, что он сам планирует и публикует посты в лучшее время.”</i>\n\n🪜 <b>How to</b>\n1. Search &#x27;Metricool MCP&#x27; → scroll down to the setup page → copy the MCP URL: https://ai.metricool.com/mcp\n2. Open Claude.ai → Customize → Connectors → &#x27;+&#x27; → Add custom connector\n3. Name the connector &#x27;Metricool&#x27; and paste the URL\n4. Create a Metricool account and connect your social networks (Instagram, TikTok, LinkedIn, Threads, YouTube, etc.)\n5. Prompt Claude: &#x27;Use Metricool and look at top posts from competitors and give me 10 content ideas based on what works&#x27;\n6. Claude can also auto-schedule and publish posts at the optimal time based on analytics\n\n<i>Useful for: Content creators who want Claude to read their social media analytics, analyze competitors, generate content ideas, and auto-schedule posts.</i>\n\n💾 <i>15-minute setup tutorial for giving Claude direct read/write access to social media analytics and scheduling via Metricool MCP — replaces manual competitor research and posting.</i>\n🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DaxnjDwIkKg/\">Original reel</a>\n<i>#claude-mcp #metricool #social-media-automation</i>",
