    "digest": "<b>Self-Development Maxxing Framework</b>\n<i>A four-layer framework for total self-development: reprogram the subconscious, regulate the nervous system, rebuild identity, and master mindset.</i>\n\n🔑 <b>Key points</b>\n• Subconscious Reprogramming: Mental Rehearsal, Belief Reframing, Pattern Interruption, Pre-Sleep Programming, Emotional Conditioning, Environmental Conditioning, Identity Reinforcement\n• Nervous System Maxxing: Breath Regulation, Morning Sunlight, Sleep Optimisation, Somatic Release, Stress Capacity, Stillness Practice, Discomfort Exposure\n• Identity Maxxing: Define Your Identity, Standards Over Goals, Identity-Based Action, Environment Design, Evidence Collection, Kill the Old Self\n• Mindset Maxxing: Control Your Attention, Reframe Adversity, Detach From Outcomes, Question Your Thoughts, Think Long-Term, Observer Over Reactor\n\n💾 <i>A clean, layered map of self-development levers — subconscious, nervous system, identity, and mindset — organised into actionable named practices.</i>\n🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Db8rCYmjihI/\">Original reel</a>\n<i>#rewiring #identity #nervous-system</i>",
    "markdown": "<b>Self-Development Maxxing Framework</b><br><i>A four-layer framework for total self-development: reprogram the subconscious, regulate the nervous system, rebuild identity, and master mindset.</i><br>🔑 <b>Key points</b><br><ul><li>Subconscious Reprogramming: Mental Rehearsal, Belief Reframing, Pattern Interruption, Pre-Sleep Programming, Emotional Conditioning, Environmental Conditioning, Identity Reinforcement</li><li>Nervous System Maxxing: Breath Regulation, Morning Sunlight, Sleep Optimisation, Somatic Release, Stress Capacity, Stillness Practice, Discomfort Exposure</li><li>Identity Maxxing: Define Your Identity, Standards Over Goals, Identity-Based Action, Environment Design, Evidence Collection, Kill the Old Self</li><li>Mindset Maxxing: Control Your Attention, Reframe Adversity, Detach From Outcomes, Question Your Thoughts, Think Long-Term, Observer Over Reactor</li></ul><br>💾 <i>A clean, layered map of self-development levers — subconscious, nervous system, identity, and mindset — organised into actionable named practices.</i><br>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Db8rCYmjihI/\">Original reel</a><br><i>#rewiring #identity #nervous-system</i><details><summary>📄 Full transcript</summary>A visual framework breaking total self-development into four pillars — each with 6–7 named techniques — covering the subconscious, nervous system, identity, and mindset layers.\n\n<b>Slide 1</b> — <i>Title card with collage of brain, historical figure, philosopher statue, meditating man, runner, anatomical figure, and eye</i>\nThe art of self-development maxxing\n@rewirewithjake\n\n<b>Slide 2</b> — <i>Seven subconscious reprogramming techniques arranged around the central title</i>\nSubconscious Reprogramming Maxxing\n1. Mental Rehearsal\n2. Belief Reframing\n3. Pattern Interruption\n4. Pre-Sleep Programming\n5. Emotional Conditioning\n6. Environmental Conditioning\n7. Identity Reinforcement\n\n<b>Slide 3</b> — <i>Seven nervous system regulation practices arranged around the central title</i>\nNervous System Maxxing\n1. Breath Regulation\n2. Morning Sunlight\n3. Sleep Optimisation\n4. Somatic Release\n5. Stress Capacity\n6. Stillness Practice\n7. Discomfort Exposure\n\n<b>Slide 4</b> — <i>Six identity-building steps arranged around the central title</i>\nIdentity Maxxing\n1. Define Your Identity\n2. Standards Over Goals\n3. Identity-Based Action\n4. Environment Design\n5. Evidence Collection\n6. Kill the Old Self\n\n<b>Slide 5</b> — <i>Six mindset practices arranged around the central title</i>\nMindset Maxxing\n1. Control Your Attention\n2. Reframe Adversity\n3. Detach From Outcomes\n4. Question Your Thoughts\n5. Think Long-Term\n6. Observer Over Reactor\n\n<b>Slide 6</b> — <i>CTA slide promoting Jake&#x27;s free guide &#x27;How to Upgrade Every Level of Yourself&#x27; — part of the EPI Method</i>\nReady to upgrade every level of yourself?\nComment &quot;REWIRE&quot; to get my free guide and start becoming the next version of yourself.\nA PRACTICAL GUIDE\nHow to Upgrade Every Level of Yourself\nUnderstand your stress responses, widen your window of tolerance, and train your body to feel safe — so you can think clearly, feel calmer, and finally break the patterns that keep you stuck.\nWritten by Jake – Creator of the EPI Method</details>",
