  "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DcCl1JoIEp8/": {
    "status": "done",
    "digest": "“<b>you only ever met the tired version</b>”\n— its.toby.again\n\n<i>Your parents had whole lives, fears, and a version of themselves that quietly ended when you arrived — and they hid all of it so you never had to feel the weight.</i>\n💡 <b>They were your age once, winging it and scared — and that&#x27;s how good they were at making it look easy.</b>\n\n💾 <i>A precise, emotionally resonant articulation of a feeling most people have had but never put into words — the kind of reframe that lingers.</i>\n🔗 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DcCl1JoIEp8/\">Original reel</a>\n<i>#family #nostalgia #inner-child</i>",
