hysical mess, not a digital one. Read two pages of a book the moment you reach for your phone. Same hand, different object. Practice the skill for 10 minutes instead of watching someone else do it. Your hands on the instrument, not your eyes on the feed. Sit outside for two minutes before you go back indoors. Nothing in your hands, nothing playing, just sit. And get so used to filling the gap yourself that the scroll stops being the default.</details>",
