                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Phase 2 — Commitment: accept you can't do everything; narrow to 2–3 interests that survived exploration and build depth through reps without visible results; choosing feels like losing options, but depth is the price of entry to phase 3"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "blocks": [
